Earlier this year, we introduced new AI capabilities for legal professionals. Today, we’re expanding them with more than 20 legal skills and new partner-built plugins.

@Microsoft Copilot can now help lawyers turn an approved template into a new agreement, review a contract and suggest tracked changes in Word, or find important obligations and deadlines across a collection of documents. With @MSFTCopilot Cowork, it can also bring together information from agreements, emails, meetings, and files to help a legal team make sense of a complex matter.

That means less time spent pulling the pieces together and more time for the judgment, counsel, and problem-solving that clients count on.

